Hollow version of the original.
- Some of the music that was hugely nostalgic to me is not here, because of non-renewal of licenses;
- The AI feels quite janky;
- My Xbox controller does not work in the menu;
- I am just not used to some of the new controls, like the hold to pedal faster on the cycle. 

I was not even in an hour and I got hugely turned off. Just play the original...
